# Visualization bootstrap for the lab.
#
# Geometry setup, source presets, and scenario commands should already be set by
# the caller before this file is executed. This file initializes the run and then
# applies the standard visual scene configuration used by the lab.


/control/verbose 0
/tracking/verbose 0
/run/verbose 0
/event/verbose 0

/run/initialize
/control/execute vis.mac